    hSrc: "Sources: NASA, ESA and Wikipedia (links above). Patches: NASA via Wikimedia Commons. Artemis status as of November 2026.",
    xTitle: "Stand on the Moon", xIntro: "Rotate the Moon and click a point (or pick one at random). Then land and look around: you'll see where the Sun and Earth are from there.",
    xRandom: "Random point", xLand: "Land and look around", xBack: "Back to the globe", xNone: "No point chosen",
